/// Interpolation reads the binding visible where the string is written:
/// a shadow inside a block, the outer one after it, and a captured variable.
x | 1
if true
    x [= 2
    say("in {x}")
xx
say("out {x}")
act outer()
    n | 5
    act inner()
        return "n={n}"
    xx
    return inner()
xx
say(outer())
